8.jpg"}, {"id": 1536057, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwx89.jpg"}, {"id": 1536058, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwx8a.jpg"}, {"id": 1536059, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwx8b.jpg"}, {"id": 1536060, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwx8c.jpg"}, {"id": 1536061, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwx8d.jpg"}], "slug": "night-to-meet-chu", "storyline": "A peculiar daily life begins with a pure-hearted ghost girl... Mare, a sweet and gentle ghost girl has suddenly appeared in front of the exhausted protagonist. Although she\u2019s a ghost, she goes out of her way to bring comfort and ease to the protagonist. Yet, she never fails to make their heart race... From park strolls to ramen shops, from courage-testing adventures to quaint inns, the two enjoyed a series of dates.\n\nBut... Lurking in the background are memories that can\u2019t quite be recalled. A reason that binds Mare to this world, preventing her from finding eternal peace. What hidden past do these two shares? Will you join her in an enchanting and tender journey of companionship and mystery?", "summary": "An ASMR-enhanced visual novel game starring VTuber NightMare herself! What is the secret hidden your encounter and her inability to find eternal peace?", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/night-to-meet-chu"}